'''Sacrificial Zeal''' is a [[buff]] granted by {{il|Hand of the Fervent}}.

==Mechanics==
{{il|Hand of the Fervent}} grants Sacrificial Zeal on use of a skill for 4 seconds. It causes you to gain added physical damage equal to 25% of the skill’s mana cost and take physical damage over time equal to a percentage of the skill’s mana cost.

It will not grant added damage if the cost of the skill is more than the maximum amount you could spend. This can be a result of conditional or rotating cost modifiers such as {{il|Indigon}} increasing the cost after the skill is used or if you were able to ignore the skill's cost while having its actual cost exceed your unreserved maximum mana, such as with {{psl|From Below}}.

